{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedTableau","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedTableau","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Combinatorics.Young.SemistandardTableau","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedInsertion"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordSSYT_entry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordSSYT_entry","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedTableau.lean#L103-L104","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordSSYT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordSSYT","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedTableau.lean#L95-L101","doc":"The insertion tableau `P(w)` of a word `w`, realised as a Mathlib\nsemistandard Young tableau on the shape `tableauShape (insertWord w)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.toSSYT_entry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.toSSYT_entry","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedTableau.lean#L91-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.toSSYT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.toSSYT","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedTableau.lean#L73-L89","doc":"**The Schensted semistandard Young tableau.**  A list tableau with weakly\nincreasing rows (`RowsSorted`) and strictly increasing columns (`ColStrict`)\nis a Mathlib `SemistandardYoungTableau` on its row-length shape, with\n`entry i j = (T.getD i []).getD j 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.tableauShape_sorted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.tableauShape_sorted","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedTableau.lean#L65-L71","doc":"The shape list of a column-strict tableau is weakly decreasing, hence a valid\n`ofRowLens` argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_shape_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_shape_iff","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedTableau.lean#L47-L63","doc":"Membership in the row-length Young diagram, expressed via `getD` on `T`.\nRouted through the unconditional `shape_getD` and Mathlib's own `getElem?`\nlemmas, so it does not depend on the `getD_row_*` case split. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.shape_getD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.shape_getD","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedTableau.lean#L39-L45","doc":"Row-length lookup of the shape is the length of that row (out-of-range rows\nare empty on both sides, so this holds unconditionally). ","signatureChunk":0}]}